      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b2d939/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-20T22:57:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'd always been under that impression as well, so the two together allow her to sprint (possibly avoiding the attack) and counterstrike. &nbsp;Normally, only useful against melee attacks, since combat stance resolves second, so the counterstrike wouldn't have LOS if the shift moved out of LOS of the original attack, but also works against area attacks and external hazard generators, since the attacker and &nbsp;the source of the attack are not the same, so she can sometimes maintain LOS to the former while obstructing it from the latter.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:04:43.514Z",
